# Playwright Test Agents

Follow [Playwright Test Agents](https://playwright.dev/docs/test-agents).

## Agents

| Agent | Role | Definition |
|-------|------|------------|
| 🎭 planner | Explore app → Markdown plan in `specs/` | `.github/agents/playwright-test-planner.agent.md` |
| 🎭 generator | Plan → Playwright tests under `tests/` | `.github/agents/playwright-test-generator.agent.md` |
| 🎭 healer | Fix failing tests | `.github/agents/playwright-test-healer.agent.md` |

## Conventions for this project

- Seed: `tests/seed.spec.ts` (ExpandTesting home + dialog dismiss)
- Plans: `specs/*.md` (starter: `specs/expand-core-journeys.md`)
- MCP: `.vscode/mcp.json` → `npx playwright run-test-mcp-server`
- Existing suite is mostly **JavaScript** + Cucumber POM under `pages/`, `features/`, `stepdefinitions/`
- Prefer generating Playwright specs that reuse `pages/ExpandTestingPage.js` / `ExpandPageExerciser.js` when useful
- After upgrading `@playwright/test`, run `npm run agents:init`

## Typical prompts

1. Plan: use `.github/prompts/playwright-test-plan.prompt.md`
2. Generate: use `.github/prompts/playwright-test-generate.prompt.md`
3. Heal: use `.github/prompts/playwright-test-heal.prompt.md`
